msgid "Invalid warehouse-allowed-networks! Only values of `external-only`, `allow-private`,` and `allow-all` are allowed."
msgstr "Nieprawidłowe warehouse-allowed-networks! Dozwolone są tylko wartości `external-only`, `allow-private`,` i `allow-all`."

